# sqlx checksums each migration as Sha384 over its raw bytes
# (sqlx-core-0.8.6/src/migrate/migration.rs:25) and refuses to run against a
# database whose stored checksum differs (migrator.rs:175, returned as
# MigrateError::VersionMismatch). A CRLF checkout therefore checksums
# differently from an LF one, and a database written on one platform is
# rejected on the other.
#
# Pinning these to LF keeps the bytes identical on every platform regardless
# of core.autocrlf. Changes here change migration checksums, so do not add
# other patterns to this file without meaning to.
schema/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
